# Optional environment variables for local dev.
#
# LLM provider configuration is delegated to opencode (see ~/.config/opencode/).
#
# Backend (just dev):
# VOXPILOT_PORT=8000
# VOXPILOT_OC_PORT=0
# VOXPILOT_DB_PATH=voxpilot.db
#
# Frontend (just dev-frontend):
#   Vite proxies /oc and /api here.
# VOXPILOT_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# For wiring a local backend through a local gateway, see `just dev-gateway`.
